{
  "about": "Rule pack v0 for the archetype scorer (spec: Vehicle fingerprinting, 'Archetypes'). Each archetype applies to some vehicle classes and lists weighted conditions on fingerprint features. A condition counts only when its feature is known; a parameter still at its firmware default is not known, since nobody chose it for this vehicle. Score: the weight of the conditions met over the weight of the conditions known. Confidence: the weight known over the weight listed. Prop class comes first, as ArduPilot's tuning guide scales its starting values with prop size (https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/setting-up-for-tuning.html): MOT_THST_EXPO about 0.55, 0.65, 0.75 and 0.8, and INS_GYRO_FILTER about 80, 40, 20 and 10 Hz, for 5, 10, 20 and 30 inch props. Motor frequencies at hover are rough starting values. Nothing here is calibrated yet: calibration uses the labelled log corpus.",
